{"server":"cn","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_05_end","groupId":"act42side","stageId":"act42side_05","title":"共融","storyCode":"MT-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"3c7c2d3b2ce187b2e7c87d0ea7d2aeb338d443dd02c4260a572a2486cfe53ef6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"牧首邀请安多恩参与育婴圣堂未来更宏大的计划。能天使因试图阻碍降生仪式被逮捕，所有非萨科塔都被铳骑以各种理由带走。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"木攀兽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个响动......别紧张，孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牧首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保育员先生，你也在。真是辛苦了，感谢你在这段时间的付出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是尽我所能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个小家伙还很脆弱。安多恩，带他回他母亲身边去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我随后便去找你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牧首，您看起来有些虚弱......需要我护送您回去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨，只是刚刚的心跳声仍在我的体内回响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不止那位母亲，帕特里奇昂，我听到了不计其数的心跳在共鸣，几乎要震塌这座圣堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论出身，不论种族，人们已经开始连结......但也有人已经拒绝了我们所展示的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"降生仪式可以到此为止了，不必让同胞们在此逗留，准备下一步的工作吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。还请您去休息，这边剩下的事情交给我就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g2_baptismlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再次感谢各位来到育婴圣堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论诸位是否理解，又怎样看待先前牧首在峰会上提出的主张，这只木攀兽的降生与启圣，无疑都给予了我们更明晰的启示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于如何跨越“国家”“种族”的隔阂，关于如何从根本上消弭仇恨、缔造和平......关于如何共同应对悬于头顶的灾异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以降生仪式为起点，第二届万国峰会将正式进入下一阶段——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰将向所有萨科塔之外的种族分享光环！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“愿主将属灵的恩典赐予每一人。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，莫斯提马，这边这边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪乐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么时候回来的？怎么也不跟我们说一声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这身新衣服不错嘛，这副新手铐也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来想过段时间给你们一个惊喜的，这不是......嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（试图挠头）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一两句话说不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不，我帮你争取两分钟逃跑？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也行——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是别给我老姐添乱了，下次吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我是不是打扰你们几位好友团聚了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前辈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安枢机，你自己一个人就能够将嫌犯带回第七厅吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，需要支援......？毕竟试图破坏育婴圣堂，干涉万国峰会，可是干系重大！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不放心的话，前辈你可以和我一起，或者让铳骑监督。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说话嘛。毕竟根据阿摩斯辅佐官的证词，你确实之前就在其他案发现场发现了蕾缪乐的踪迹......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想说，我试图包庇自己的妹妹？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒是没有，毕竟都是间接证据，不足以说明你采取了什么行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得我们之前在圣堂内的谈话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很欣赏你的能力和办事手段，“噤声的蕾缪安”，不过我也清楚你那些美好的品质一般在什么时候最能得到体现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况这次牵涉到的是你的妹妹，我们有所怀疑也是在所难免，请你理解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1811_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们大可放心。放小乐背着一身罪名乱跑，并不能真正帮到她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，只要蕾缪乐能够配合，我相信这里面的误会一定能解开的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍微等等，“微光守夜人”，还有......万国信使莫斯提马。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_1780_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位请暂时留在育婴圣堂，教皇厅有些任务需要交给两位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小乐姐......被带走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，好不容易说服老师让我出来，还是没来得及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这，怎么办，梵妮，你还能做些什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g4_nurseryindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必叩门，安多恩。我没有任何事需要回避你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子的母亲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经入睡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把这孩子带了过来。他羽毛还没长齐，但惊人地有活力。我猜，您或许会想再摸摸他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。这于我也是一种慰藉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得吗？你我来到拉特兰后，为了安置这孩子的母亲，临时建了这间屋子，后来它成了整座圣堂的第一间育婴室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。我和您一起铺好了这简陋却温暖的床铺，挂好了安抚铃，让她得以安睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然这个房间早已不再使用，但我时常会重回这里，哪怕只是简单地祷告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这里是你我的起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"木攀兽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（惬意地舒展身体）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感受到，他也喜欢这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，这孩子的光环真闪亮啊。你抱他进来的时候，我就感受到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是您一直以来坚信的奇迹，牧首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我仍不明白，您是如何在最初见到他的母亲时，就看到了奇迹的预兆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，安多恩，我那时没有看到任何预兆，我只看到你的内心在挣扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她那时已油尽灯枯，需要的并非救治，而是安葬。但你仍想救她，你不希望这念头在常识的冲刷下消散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我坚信的，是你精心保护的那一个念头，可以缔造生命的奇迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生命是伟大的，“常识”这种标尺从来都无法用来测量它的进程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何人都会有救她的念头，牧首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以任何人都可以缔造奇迹。或许就是因为人们不愿相信信仰的力量，奇迹才会被称作奇迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，你难道不曾想过，是光环赋予了萨科塔信仰，还是信仰为萨科塔带来了光环？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的律法、共感和铳武，以及我们依托这些建立起的乐园......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们的开端，难道真如常识所示，只是一种毫无来由的恩赐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道，牧首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去有其开端，未来亦然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"育婴圣堂......这座高耸入云的巨构，并非于一日之内落成。它的开端也只是这样一间平平无奇的育婴室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的育婴室......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我最初可曾手握宏伟圣堂的蓝图？不，我们只是想要一个安全而舒适的房间，用来安置那位母亲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它依然一发不可收拾地演化成了现在的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，一个所有人都得救的未来，当然可以发端于你我的信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牧首......我追随您，是因为我为了那样一个未来苦寻已久，而您恰巧知晓道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不曾想过，也无法理解，为何您会认为那道路的开端在于我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我终究只能做些微不足道的小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"微不足道的小事，惊天动地的壮举，不过一线之隔，一念之差。你苦寻多年才跋涉至此，不应为了这种无谓的区别而止步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧首","speakerId":"avg_npc_1777_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，除了照顾好这对母子，我需要你打起精神，去做更多的事情......比如，下一场降生仪式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g12_firearmsworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们来得要比通知里早啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该收拾的都已经收拾完了，你们直接把封条贴了吧，完事我好回去睡觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特里奇昂？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，差点骂错人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说最后的接收步骤是公证所负责吗，怎么来的是铳骑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前提是，一切正常，你没有做什么手脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚查验了工坊内的材料间，以及所有的操作设备，有明显的近期使用过的迹象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，阿摩斯枢机辅佐官上次来的时候应该声明过——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"签署关停文件后，铳械工坊一应业务即告终止，私下进行任何守护铳或者爆破物相关的制作活动将被视为违背条律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我盘下这间小作坊也有几十年了，说关就关，我舍不得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后这点时间，没忍住让这些老伙计再动了动，听听响声，流流眼泪，有什么问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"类似的说辞，您已经说过一遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的学徒，梵里妮小姐，您在育婴圣堂门口带走了她——她人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能又溜回去看降生仪式了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是个小孩子了，我的眼神又不好，怎么看得住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，潘格尼尼先生，让我们换个地方说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不愿意呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如非必要，我不应对您采取任何强制性的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潘格尼尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1781_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是帕特里奇昂那家伙让你来的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑阁下，您问席德佳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不在修道院里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在、她在的......但她刚好出了点意外，还在休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这要从哪儿说起呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天，突然有一辆告解车停在了修道院门口，席德佳修女就躺在车厢里......不、不省人事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告解车被自定义了终点，现场也没有其他人在，我们不清楚她到底遭遇了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑阁下，或许可以等她醒来，我们再让她去找您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事态紧急，带我去见她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......请不要为难格兰修女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"席德佳，你醒了，感觉还好吗？桌上的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心放心，只是有点晕而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桌上的热粥我已经喝了，咳就是因为刚刚烫到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑阁下，您是为阿尔图罗小姐的事情来的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您听我说，阿尔图罗小姐她确实擅自离开了兰登修道院......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我已经在发现后的第一时间出去追了，请相信我，我已经找到她了！但......发生了一些意想不到的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请再给兰登修道院一点时间，不，请再给我一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"席德佳修女，你介意跟我们走一趟吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我跟您去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，这位修女，你也一起吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格兰修女和这件事情没有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗小姐的监管事宜一直是我在负责，是我的失职......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别紧张，席德佳修女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兰登修道院发生了这么重大的事情，教皇厅需要知晓全部的细节，尽可能多地收集线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳骑","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，请跟我们走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
